8. submitEvidence(equipmentId, req) @Transactional
   - lock equipment → 404
   - fingerprint: equipmentId|submittedBy|expectedVersion|items canonical|materials canonical
   - idempotency "SUBMIT_EVIDENCE"
   - checkVersion → 409
